entries[258884] = { ["name"] = "Spawn of Vyranoth", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this mount.\n\nSummons and dismisses the Spawn of Vyranoth. This is a flying mount.\nRequires level 1 to 90 ( 90)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\"Vyranoth's brood was decimated by the aspects, yet Vyranoth's actions have brought many of her surviving progeny to follow in her frigid path and aid in Azeroth's defense.\"\nAchievement:\nMaster of the Turbulent Timeways V\nCategory:\nTimewalking" }
